<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Shared global application service for the anycast lab.">
  <title>Global App / Anycast Lab</title>
  <style>
    :root { --ink: #17202a; --muted: #61707a; --paper: #f7f4ed; --orange: #df6d45; --blue: #224b63; --line: #d9ded9; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; }
    .page { width: min(1060px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 30px 0 44px; }
    header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 115px; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; }
    .brand { color: var(--blue); font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .badge { padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; color: var(--orange); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 15px; color: var(--orange); font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .17em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h1 { max-width: 750px; margin: 0; color: var(--blue); font-size: clamp(3.7rem, 10vw, 8.5rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.065em; line-height: .84; }
    .lead { max-width: 490px; margin: 34px 0 75px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    .info { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 1px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--line); }
    .item { min-height: 132px; padding: 22px; background: var(--paper); }
    .item small { display: block; margin-bottom: 32px; color: var(--muted); font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .item strong { color: var(--blue); font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 400; }
    footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-top: 54px; color: var(--muted); font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-size: .72rem; }
    @media (max-width: 650px) { .page { width: min(100% - 28px, 540px); } header { margin-bottom: 76px; } .info { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } footer { flex-direction: column; margin-top: 36px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <header><div class="brand">Anycast Lab / Shared Service</div><div class="badge">Global route</div></header>
    <p class="eyebrow">Common application entry</p>
    <h1>Global App</h1>
    <p class="lead">A shared application surface available across both Ganjil and Genap zones through the common anycast network.</p>
    <section class="info" aria-label="Global application details">
      <div class="item"><small>Service address</small><strong>{{ anycast_ip }}</strong></div>
      <div class="item"><small>Server address</small><strong>{{ ansible_host }}</strong></div>
      <div class="item"><small>Available zones</small><strong>Ganjil + Genap</strong></div>
      <div class="item"><small>Access</small><strong>HTTP / HTTPS</strong></div>
    </section>
    <footer><span>Shared global application</span><span>Ready for traffic</span></footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>